OL,3,AWhat is AI, how does it work and why
OL,4,Aare some people concerned about it?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAI has increasingly become part of
OL,7,Feveryday life over the past decade.
OL,9,FThe technology takes many forms - from
OL,10,Fpersonalising social media feeds to
OL,11,Fspotting friends in smartphone photos -
OL,12,Fand accelerating medical breakthroughs.
OL,14,FBut the rise of chatbots like OpenAI's
OL,15,FChatGPT has prompted concern about the
OL,16,Ftech's environmental impact, ethical
OL,17,Fimplications and data use.
OL,19,FRecent claims that AI could become too
OL,20,Fpowerful and threaten humanity have
OL,21,Falso triggered calls for slower
OL,22,Fdevelopment and tighter regulation.
OL,23,APub: 14-JunQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/17
